newextend <pre><code>orgs.newRepo('&lt;name&gt;') {
  &lt;key&gt;: &lt;value&gt;
}
</code></pre> <pre><code>orgs.extendRepo('&lt;name&gt;') {
  &lt;key&gt;: &lt;value&gt;
}
</code></pre> <p>Note</p> <p>In general, you will only ever use <code>orgs.newRepo</code> as this function will define a new repository with default values. However, in some cases it might be needed to change properties for a repo that has already been defined in the default configuration. In such situation, you should use <code>orgs.extendRepo</code>.</p>

